"Settings > Notifications > Event Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Pop-ups en geluiden per soort melding kunnen ook worden ingesteld in "
"Systeeminstellingen > Meldingen > Event Calendar."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account"
msgstr "Google-account"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account %1"
msgstr "Google-account %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login failed: %1"
msgstr "Inloggen mislukt: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login complete."
msgstr "Ingelogd."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Could not prepare Google login: %1"
msgstr "Kan Google-login niet voorbereiden: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for browser callback..."
msgstr "Bezig met wachten op terugkoppeling van webbrowser..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for the helper page to send the code..."
msgstr "Bezig met wachten tot de hulppagina de code verstuurt..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign-in timed out. Try again."
msgstr "Inloggen duurde te lang. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed. See logs for details."
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt. Bekijk de logboeken voor details."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: invalid callback data."
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt: ongeldige terugkoppelingsgegevens."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: %1"
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: authorization code missing."
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt: autorisatiecode ontbreekt."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"The desktop could not open the browser automatically. Use the login link in "
"Advanced sign-in options instead."
msgstr ""
"De webbrowser kan niet automatisch worden geopend. Gebruik in plaats daarvan "
"de inloglink in Geavanceerde inlogopties."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Sign in to show your Google calendars and task lists. Your browser opens to "
"sign in; when access is granted the widget picks it up automatically."
msgstr ""
"Log in om je Google-agenda's en takenlijsten te tonen. Je webbrowser wordt "
"geopend om in te loggen; zodra je toegang verleent, pikt de widget dat "
"automatisch op."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign In Again"
msgstr "Opnieuw inloggen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Reload calendars and task lists"
msgstr "Agenda's en takenlijsten herladen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Remove Account"
msgstr "Account verwijderen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Verwijderen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Google access for this account expired or was revoked. Sign in again to "
"reconnect it (the account and its settings are kept)."
msgstr ""
"De Google-toegang voor dit account is verlopen of ingetrokken. Log opnieuw "
"in om de verbinding te herstellen (het account en de instellingen blijven "
"behouden)."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "The widget was updated. Sign in again to keep this account in sync."
msgstr ""
"De widget is bijgewerkt. Log opnieuw in om dit account gesynchroniseerd te "
"houden."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "No calendars loaded yet. Use the reload button."
msgstr "Er zijn nog geen agenda's geladen. Gebruik de herlaadknop."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Task Lists"
msgstr "Takenlijsten"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Add Account…"
msgstr "Account toevoegen…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign in with Google…"
msgstr "Inloggen met Google…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for the browser sign-in…"
msgstr "Bezig met wachten op inloggen in webbrowser…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Advanced sign-in options"
msgstr "Geavanceerde inlogopties"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Your own Google OAuth client, or pasting the sign-in code by hand"
msgstr "Je eigen Google OAuth-client, of de inlogcode handmatig plakken"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client Credentials"
msgstr "Clientgegevens"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Using a previously stored Google OAuth client for compatibility. If login "
"still fails, add your own client ID and client secret."
msgstr ""
"Er wordt omwille van compatibiliteit een eerder opgeslagen Google OAuth-"
"client gebruikt. Als inloggen nog steeds mislukt, voeg dan je eigen client-"
"id en clientgeheim toe."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Try desktop built-in client (no secret)"
msgstr "Ingebouwde desktopclient proberen (zonder geheim)"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client-id"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Optioneel"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Client Secret"
msgstr "Clientgeheim"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Leave these empty to use the built-in client. A custom client must be a "
"Google Cloud OAuth Desktop client, or a Web client with its secret and the "
"redirect URI set to %1."
msgstr ""
"Laat deze leeg om de ingebouwde client te gebruiken. Een aangepaste client "
"moet een Google Cloud OAuth-desktopclient zijn, of een webclient met geheim "
"en met de omleidings-uri ingesteld op %1."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"For a custom OAuth client, publish the OAuth consent screen to Production. "
"Google expires refresh tokens for external apps left in Testing after seven "
"days; Workspace session controls can also require reauthorization."
msgstr ""
"Publiceer bij een aangepaste OAuth-client het OAuth-toestemmingsscherm naar "
"Productie. Google laat vernieuwingstokens van externe apps die in Testen "
"staan na zeven dagen verlopen; ook sessiebeheer van Workspace kan om "
"herautorisatie vragen."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Manual Sign-in"
msgstr "Handmatig inloggen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login (Auto) - Add Account"
msgstr "Inloggen (automatisch) - Account toevoegen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login (Auto)"
msgstr "Inloggen (automatisch)"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Click Login (Auto) to open <a href=\"%1\">%2</a>. After you grant access, "
"the browser redirects to a localhost URL. If auto-capture succeeds you can "
"ignore the field below; otherwise copy the full URL (or just the code) and "
"paste it."
msgstr ""
"Klik op Inloggen (automatisch) om <a href=\"%1\">%2</a> te openen. Nadat je "
"toegang hebt verleend, stuurt de webbrowser je door naar een localhost-url. "
"Als automatisch vastleggen lukt, kun je het veld hieronder negeren; kopieer "
"anders de volledige url (of alleen de code) en plak die."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Click Login (Auto) to open <a href=\"%1\">%2</a>. After you grant access, "
"the browser redirects to the helper page and will try to send the code back "
"automatically. If it fails, copy the code and paste it below."
msgstr ""
"Klik op Inloggen (automatisch) om <a href=\"%1\">%2</a> te openen. Nadat je "
"toegang hebt verleend, stuurt de webbrowser je door naar de hulppagina, die "
"de code automatisch probeert terug te sturen. Als dat mislukt, kopieer dan "
"de code en plak die hieronder."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "The desktop could not open the browser automatically."
msgstr "De webbrowser kan niet automatisch worden geopend."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Copy Link"
msgstr "Link kopiëren"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Helper page (optional): <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"
msgstr "Hulppagina (optioneel): <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Helper page: <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"
msgstr "Hulppagina: <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"If your browser shows a connection error, that's expected. Copy the URL from "
"the address bar anyway and paste it below. If auto-capture works, you do not "
"need to paste anything."
msgstr ""
"Als je webbrowser een verbindingsfout toont, is dat normaal. Kopieer toch de "
"url uit de adresbalk en plak die hieronder. Als automatisch vastleggen "
"werkt, hoef je niets te plakken."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"If auto-capture fails, copy the code from the helper page and paste it below."
msgstr ""
"Als automatisch vastleggen mislukt, kopieer dan de code van de hulppagina en "
"plak die hieronder."

